B. Apify Store Gap — people on HN/Reddit asking how to scrape a site that has no Apify Store actor; agent auto-writes an actor brief to Apify's internal Slack (internal action, so fully autonomous is legal). (16)
C. Canteen closure — Google Maps permanentlyClosed canteens / company menu page disappears → displaced food budget. Data thin in Berlin, untested. (14)
D. Event hosts only (Luma/Meetup at company offices). (13)
E. Restaurant hygiene notices (Berlin district PDFs under §40 LFGB). (10)

TASK:
1. Re-score A–E on the four official criteria given the ROI point and "Clay already does hiring/funding". Table.
2. Is A's core (job ads) too close to the standard hiring signal Clay already sells? How would you make it clearly NOT a hiring signal?
3. Propose up to 2 NEW ideas whose signal is fresher than hiring/funding and has an obvious ROI number, buildable in 6h with Apify + n8n + Featherless. Signal, source, action, ROI line.
